    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d210">

                <pb facs="0263" n="247" sameAs="frus:frus1947v08/pg247"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.79611 PAA/7–1747: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Argentina</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Ray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-07-17T19:00:00-03:00">July 17, 1947—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>880. Ferreira interviewed today re route patterns of bilateral stated:</p>
                <p>During his absences Diaz Bialet’s uncontrolled activities increased FAMA disorganization. New board will be elected
                    August 18, route patterns will be ready then. Delay due entirely FAMA disorganization. Considers it advisable and
                    hopes we not press decision till August <pb facs="0264" n="248" xml:id="pg248"/>
                    18. Alternative is govt to govt negotiation since basis Argentine reply not
                    ready immediate result unlikely. Agreed meantime problems will be solved in
                    “spirit of agreement signed by both countries”.</p>
                <p>Embassy believes necessary await August 18 for route decision and in view “spirit
                    of agreement” statement agrees procedure suggested Deptel 650, July 14<anchor n="55" xml:id="d210-f1"/> when Panagra plans approved by board.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ray</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
